OL,3,GNEWSAThe buzzy community feel that
OL,4,Amakes a Birmingham road one of the
OL,5,Aworld's coolest streets
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt's the Birmingham street packed with
OL,8,Findependent shops and restaurants, has
OL,9,Fa legendary pub on the corner and a
OL,10,Funique vibe.
OL,12,FYork Road, in the lively suburb of
OL,13,FKings Heath, has been included in the
OL,14,FTime Out list of coolest streets in the
OL,15,Fworld, ranking alongside hipster
OL,16,Fhangouts in Bangkok, London and Buenos
OL,17,FAires.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
