OL,3,GNEWSAThe buzzy community feel that
OL,4,Amakes a Birmingham road one of the
OL,5,Aworld's coolest streets
OL,6,
OL,7,FGlobal entertainment magazine Time Out
OL,8,Fpraised it for its "pub tables spilling
OL,9,Facross the street, colourful painted
OL,10,Fshop fronts and a buzzy community feel
OL,11,Fthat's hard to come by in the city
OL,12,Fcentre."
OL,14,FFor Kings Heath resident Chloe
OL,15,FCarpenter, who nominated the road for
OL,16,Fthe accolade, it was the "fuzzy,
OL,17,Fcommunity feel" that made it a hit,
OL,18,Fboth among locals and visitors.
